# .dockerignore — what the Railway image must NOT carry (2026-08-18).
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so without this file EVERYTHING in the repo
# lands in the build context and the image. On 2026-08-18 the whole studio
# workspace (`studio/` — masters, research PDFs, client registers, collateral
# specs; ~106 MB tracked) moved into this repo so Claude Code and Cowork work
# from ONE clone. None of it is read by the server, so none of it belongs in
# the image. This file is what keeps "one repo" from meaning "one image that
# ships the practice's research".
#
# WHAT THE SERVER READS FROM DISK AT RUNTIME OR BUILD (measured, not assumed —
# grep for readFile/existsSync in server/, house/, shared/, vite-plugins/):
#   content/reports/*.pdf                    (reportAccess — the mailed PDFs)
#   content/collateral/smbx-corpdev-pricing.pdf  (POST /api/practice/pricing)
#   content/studio/post-queue.json + campaign-*.json  (postQueue import)
#   content/crm-seed/                        (the frozen CRM deploy fixture)
#   studio/clients/crm-bundle/*.csv          (POST /api/crm/sync-register — the
#                                             one-press register sync, 2026-08-19)
#   scripts/studio/reports/*.md              (reportQA context + vite build)
#   client/public/**                         (logos, textures for composers)
#   server/migrations/*.sql, server/templates/**, server/prompts/**
#   house/**, shared/**, client/src/**       (bundled by vite / esbuild)
# Nothing below excludes any of those. If you add a runtime read of a new
# directory, un-ignore it here in the same commit, or production 404s quietly.

# ── the studio workspace: documents are files, and none of them ship ─────
# …except the LIVING CRM REGISTER (~150 KB of CSVs), which
# /api/crm/sync-register reads at runtime so one press in Leads refreshes the
# app from whatever register the deployed commit carries (2026-08-19). The
# route 409s with this file's name if the exception ever goes missing.
studio/
!studio/clients/crm-bundle
!studio/clients/crm-bundle/**

# ── version control + local build state ──────────────────────────────────
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
node_modules
dist
dist-preview
test-results
playwright-report
fold-shots
mobile-shots
uploads
database.db
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# ── agent/editor state ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude
.agents
.github
.worktreeinclude
.impeccable.md

# ── design handoffs, docs, methodology, test fixtures — read by people ────
design_handoff_*
smbX.ai Marketing Redesign
corpdevservices
practiceSite
docs
methodology
testing
studio-kit

# ── large media that has a served, optimised copy elsewhere ──────────────
# (client/public/textures/blackbleed.webp is the served texture; the 8.4 MB
#  master lives at the repo root only as history)
*.mp4
*.mov
*.m4v
blackBleedBG.png

# ── root-level docs (root-only match; nested *.md such as
#    scripts/studio/reports/*.md are NOT touched by this pattern) ──────────
*.md
